{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-05_end",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-05",
  "title": "誰的戰爭",
  "storyCode": "12-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6e624454c893d2f5ee22a2218c353969221736b42b408fbd25cd2aaecafbc41",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "咕......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我這裡......真的沒有什麼東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饑餓的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "別裝蒜！我們看得一清二楚，你用過爐子，你從哪裡搞到的吃的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饑餓的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "為什麼你每天都能搞到吃的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我......只是碰巧撿到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饑餓的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "撿到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "別弄得太過火，小心這小子急性礦石病發作，害得我們一起完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饑餓的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "你的倉庫到底在哪裡？說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我真的......只是撿到......有人把東西放在了我的窗台上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饑餓的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "還不老實——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_334",
      "text": "他的話就那麼不值得你們相信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_334",
      "text": "感染者偶爾也會走運一回，撿到點吃的吧。這又有什麼稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "饑餓的暴徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "你又是誰？也是來搶東西的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_334",
      "text": "你們好，我叫雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_334",
      "text": "以前在烏薩斯的時候，他們也叫我“紅刀”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "text": "加快速度，跟上我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "再堅持一下！我們就快到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "該死，他們的人越來越多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "白狼，我聽過你和你家族的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "很高興今天能在這裡和你並肩而戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "為了我們的倫蒂尼姆，為了我們的維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "你想幹什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "text": "別停下，繼續跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "薩卡茲的叛徒和維多利亞的蟲子們，這場沒完沒了的追逐戰也該結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "你們想跑到哪裡去？你們想逃過自己的死亡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "你們，你們的那些躲在暗處的朋友，都會被我們撕碎，這是你們欠我們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "這是倫蒂尼姆，是維多利亞，是這片大地的每一個人欠我們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "跑吧，跑吧，你們跑不過風暴，跑不過戰爭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "閉上你的嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "（嘖，人太多了，必須想辦法突破這裡！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "（我只剩下最後一枚榴彈......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "羅本，帶好這枚榴彈。往下走，直接炸開動力層的底層甲板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "Misery，保護好他們，你們還要繼續往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "text": "......我知道了，放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "剩下的，就交給運氣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "號角，你要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "閉上你的嘴，我沒空再給你一拳頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "號角轉過身，面對著如潮水一般湧來的敵人。\n她微微扯了扯嘴角，這一切也該結束了。\n這些逃亡，這些戰鬥，這些徹夜難眠的夜晚。\n軍人本就該死在戰爭中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "不知道......風笛現在怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她握緊武器，準備衝鋒。\n陰雲籠罩的天空下，一陣奇怪的聲音傳來，由遠及近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "很熟悉的聲音，只是很久沒有再在倫蒂尼姆城內響起。\n人們只有在久遠的回憶與模糊的傳言中才能找到那個聲音的來源——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "那是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "text": "號角，走，趁這個機會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“最後的蒸汽騎士”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "（沉悶的噴氣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“最後的蒸汽騎士”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "“維多利亞”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "該死，這些門——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "太厚了，對面聽不到我們的聲音！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "嘖，克洛維希婭和凱瑟琳都被他們帶走了，是想用她們作為和薩卡茲交換的條件嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "這些人，這些可恥的叛徒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "閃靈小姐，你能不能打開這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我們不能再耽擱了，我們不知道那些薩卡茲們什麼時候會過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "我可以試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "不！別！別鬧出那麼大的動靜！這樣只會更快地引來敵人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "在這裡的都是重傷患和非戰鬥人員，如果真的和王庭的人開打了，我們走得掉，他們怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "可是等在這裡一樣是死。我不知道我的那些朋友們打的什麼主意，但我猜不會只是把我們放在這裡不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "我的無人機上有個小型雷射切割裝置，這些鋼板很厚，但只要再給我點時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "要多少時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "別急！我得先測試功率......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "費斯特，還記得老比爾的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "一定是......一定是那種怪物又混進了我們之中，他又一次欺騙了我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "我們太大意了，我們應該早點發現的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "那種能夠變換外貌的薩卡茲......費斯特，會不會這裡也有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "有那種東西存在，我們到底......該信任誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "如果......不是呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "可那些人是我們的戰友！那些人也是倫蒂尼姆的工人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我知道，我和他們一起長大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "但如果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "如果這就是他們自己的選擇，湯米、帕特和戴，他們和別人一起做出了這個決定呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "可是，為什麼......他們明明是我們的同伴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "接受同伴被頂替總比承認同伴的背叛來得要容易一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "可是，這件事還是這麼發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我能猜到一點他們的想法，等到憤怒帶來的熱血消散後，繼續選擇戰鬥並不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "克洛維希婭說過，說到底，我們不過是些普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我必須承認......就連我，都同樣恐懼離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "逃避和退縮，是我們每個普通人在面對一場戰爭時......最下意識的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "那你大可以留下！和你的那些朋友們一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我不會這麼做，洛洛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我必須認清恐懼，才能警醒自己......勇氣的價值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我願意相信，他們還不至於真的跨過那條線。我願意相信，他們只是被恐懼所裹挾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "可這些都無關緊要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "我會救出奶奶和克洛維希婭的，和上次一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "但是這些傷患耽擱不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "無人機的雷射切割裝置已經在工作了！大概需要......呃，二十分鐘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "text": "我也來幫忙，我隨身帶了些工具！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "你的錘子和扳手在這裡派不上用場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "耐心點，我們再等一會，就可以這麼安靜地離開這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "怎、怎麼？我沒監聽到薩卡茲的行動啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4072_ironmn_1",
      "text": "閃靈小姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "啊，閃靈，好久不見。聽說你去了家族聚會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "......W，你來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "W！現在半個倫蒂尼姆都聽到這裡的動靜了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "很隆重，對吧，我對炸藥的份量把握得一直很準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "我聽說凱爾希被揍得很慘，於是就百忙之中抽空來看看囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "嗚哇，果然很慘，特雷西斯還真是不留情面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "我還以為那男人會對自己的“老朋友”溫柔一點呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "她還沒醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "那還真是遺憾，我該為她擠出幾滴淚嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "或者，趁機讓這個老女人再也不敢得罪我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（喑啞的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "呃，這東西倒居然還活著嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（威脅的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "嘖，怎麼還這麼凶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "text": "Mon3tr受損很嚴重，直到兩個小時以前才重新恢復運動機能，但我仍然不建議你去惹它，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "我可是在救它主子的命，它起碼應該學著更尊重我一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "否則的話，哼哼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（妥協的低鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "這還差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "王庭軍的人正在趕過來！快點，我們得在他們來之前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "別吵吵嚷嚷的，可露希爾，耳朵疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "你以為都是誰的錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "那就快點讓你的人邁開腿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "我在倫蒂尼姆城外倒是有幾個好去處，要來瞧瞧嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "我們的物資，如果以最好的情況來估計，還能再撐上一個星期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "如果以最壞的情況來估計呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "好吧，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我和卡鐸爾會繼續想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "外面的情況現在怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "一個平常住著一萬人不到的街區，被塞進來了數倍的人口，沒有額外的補給，沒有警察和法律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "過了這麼些天，我們還活著，這就已經該感謝市民們那些殘存的道德了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "也許只是卡鐸爾的拳頭足夠硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我不否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "有聽到大公爵們的動向嗎？我聽說......溫德米爾公爵的軍隊駐地離這裡應該不遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "他們......應該不會對我們的境遇視而不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "零星有些傳言......有人說，在夜晚看到過劃過的火光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我們都見過薩卡茲那個飛在天上的東西......我們剛被扔出倫蒂尼姆的那天，它的影子劃過了整個地塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我猜，大公爵們都很忌憚那東西，他們現在只敢試探性地發起進攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "當然，也有可能外面已經打得昏天黑地，倫蒂尼姆城被炸了個稀巴爛，天知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "會不會是大公爵們不知道地塊上還有人活著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "她......他們以為......我們都已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "如果我們能把訊息傳出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "怎麼傳？城際通訊網路早就癱瘓了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我們這些被困在封鎖區的可憐蟲，還是擔心下明天的口糧吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "......真不敢想像，好像就在幾天前，我們還在影廳裡看藍卡塢的那些爛片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "那部片子叫什麼來著？《變種怪傑大亂戰》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "結局其實還蠻感人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我不知道，我睡著了，就看到最後的爆炸把那座移動城市炸上了天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我只記得麥克拉倫先生的錢給得倒是很大方，畢竟我們確實幫他的影廳擺平過很多次麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "但願他現在還好，現在外面的環境恐怕對他的神經衰弱沒有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "我去影廳看過，他把門封得很嚴實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "不過，你為什麼總喜歡在影廳睡覺？我們第一次認識，也是因為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "因為你的笑聲把我吵醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "抱歉，可那個片子真的很好笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "說到底，是在影廳睡覺的你不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "在那裡睡覺很舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "那個喜劇導演很有名的，我有她全部的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "代表饑餓的咕嚕聲不合時宜地響起，打破了好不容易才稍顯輕鬆的氣氛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "你吃得有些太少了，這樣你沒法保持體力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "沒事的，我們得繼續撐下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "......我們曾經的生活就這麼結束了。一轉眼，一切就變成了現在的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "到處是瘋子，到處是屍體，還有薩卡茲建起的封鎖牆......這些天不是沒人試過突破那裡，他們的腦袋現在還掛在牆邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我至今也沒想明白，怎麼就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "戰爭爆發了，貝爾德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我知道，我知道！可就是因為“戰爭爆發了”這輕飄飄的幾個字......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "所有的過去就在一瞬間煙消雲散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "這是誰的戰爭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "公爵們是為了保護維多利亞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我只知道，它不屬於我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣細碎的響動從黑暗中傳來，還有罐頭與罐頭輕輕碰撞的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "......你在幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "膽怯的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "text": "我......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "今天不是你守夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "你大衣裡藏的是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "膽怯的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_177",
      "text": "別......別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
